sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass 20261119.1~sparky9~0 (2026-11-19)
  * The 3D icons (the empty and the full Trash) take one separation for the screen, never a share of the icon's size: the model's nearest point stands 1 pixel in front of the screen and its farthest 1 pixel behind it, pixels of a screen 1920 wide, at every size from 16 to 256 px (before, 3 % of the picture's width, so sizes up to 64 px were flat). tools/icons3d/scene.py takes the range as pixels; candidate b (popped 4, sunk 10, the desktop's limits) is kept beside it for Daniel's pick (ORDER 750)
  * index.theme gives every stereo folder X-StereoLayout=sbs-left-first, the one layout KIconThemes' loadStereoIcon() reads: without it the loader dropped every stereo folder ("Invalid X-StereoLayout line") and no program could draw the Trash as a pair; Dolphin's item view then draws it per eye (measured in a Stereo KWin rig, ORDER 750a)

sparky-stereo-look-kubabbar-glass 20261104.1~sparky9~0 (2026-11-04)
  * kubabbar-glass-minimize and kubabbar-glass-style no longer discard a failure: a setting that cannot be saved, a KWin that does not report the effect loaded, a style plugin that is not installed and a signal that cannot reach the running programs are each said (terminal and journal, in the nine languages) and kept in sparky-stereo-problems until a retry works; "done" is printed only after KWin or the saved value confirms it. The saved setting and the look's values are unchanged
  * The menu bar package (kubabbar-glass-minimize) and the look package depend on sparky-stereo-problems; sparky-stereo-gtk is unchanged (its failures were already said in 20261102.2)

